{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50896","headline":"戏赠乡人 · 王贞白","name":"戏赠乡人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年内展室考文华，咫尺天颜隔绦纱。\n御榜早闻传异国，乡人犹似薄东家。\n中宵纵匣冲星劒，临水难留上汉槎。\n明日春风动行色，惟愁重别故林花。\n（此见《永乐大典》卷三○○四「九真」「人」字〖五函四十一册〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}